id: button-group
name: Button group (connected, single or multi select)
category: actions
summary: A row of related toggle buttons that read as one control. The selected button morphs to a full pill.
requires: foundation, button
@@spec
- Connected group: 2dp gap, inner corners extra-small, outer corners full. Selected button is full-round, the rest keep the small inner radius.
- Use for 2 to 5 mutually related choices (a view switch, a time range). More than 5 becomes a menu or a chip set.
- Same label role as buttons (Label Large). Group height follows the button size.
@@a11y
- role="group" with an aria-label that names the choice.
- Every button carries aria-pressed (true/false), updated wherever the selection changes, including timers and resets.
- For a single-select group, JS sets aria-pressed on the chosen button and clears the others.
@@html
<div class="md-btn-group" role="group" aria-label="Chart range">
  <button class="md-btn md-btn--tonal" type="button" aria-pressed="false">1D</button>
  <button class="md-btn md-btn--tonal" type="button" aria-pressed="true">7D</button>
  <button class="md-btn md-btn--tonal" type="button" aria-pressed="false">30D</button>
</div>
@@css
.md-btn-group {
  display: inline-flex;
  gap: 0.125rem;
}

.md-btn-group > .md-btn {
  border-radius: var(--shape-xs);
  padding: 0 var(--sp-lg);
}
.md-btn-group > .md-btn:first-child {
  border-start-start-radius: var(--shape-full);
  border-end-start-radius: var(--shape-full);
}
.md-btn-group > .md-btn:last-child {
  border-start-end-radius: var(--shape-full);
  border-end-end-radius: var(--shape-full);
}

/* inside a group the selected button reads as the full pill, the opposite of a lone toggle */
.md-btn-group > .md-btn[aria-pressed="true"] { border-radius: var(--shape-full); }
.md-btn-group > .md-btn:active { border-radius: var(--shape-sm); }
@@js
// Single-select: keep aria-pressed in sync on every button of the group.
document.addEventListener('click', function (ev) {
  var btn = ev.target.closest('.md-btn-group > .md-btn');
  if (!btn) return;
  btn.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.md-btn').forEach(function (b) {
    b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(b === btn));
  });
});
